# Configure your documentation project

You can change your documentation project by:

- [changing the site configuration options](./global_configuration)
- [structuring your documentation](./structure_docs) to be single or multipage
- configuring individual page settings using [page frontmatter](./frontmatter)
- [setting an expiration date](./page_expiry_and_review) for a page
